  /// a call to `close()`. To flush all buffered writes, call `flush()` before
  /// calling `close()`.
  Future close();

  /// A future that will complete when the consumer closes, or when an
  /// error occurs.
  ///
  /// This future is identical to the future returned by [close].
  Future get done;
}

